cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Cito PDF: the instant PDF reader for research"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Aldoboni
    given-names: Ghaleb
repository-code: "https://github.com/GhalebAldoboni/citopdf"
url: "https://ghalebaldoboni.github.io/citopdf/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.6.1
date-released: 2026-09-07
abstract: "A free, open-source Chrome extension that replaces the built-in PDF viewer with a research reader: PDFs stream in and open before the download finishes, every in-text citation shows a Google Scholar popup with Cite and Save, and rendering is tuned to stay fast on low-memory machines."
keywords: [PDF reader, Chrome extension, citations, Google Scholar, streaming, pdf.js, research papers]
